WEBVTT

01:32.967 --> 01:38.348
THIRD STORY
SENIOR APPRENTICES

01:39.349 --> 01:40.350
All right.

01:51.986 --> 01:52.904
Pardon me!

01:53.571 --> 01:55.949
Master, I've brought you some tea.

01:56.032 --> 02:00.453
Hey! Long time no see, Masaki!
How've you been?

02:00.954 --> 02:02.288
Well, well, Masaki.

02:02.372 --> 02:05.291
It's been a long time.
How are things with you?

02:05.375 --> 02:07.585
Yo! Master Masaki, long time no see!

02:07.669 --> 02:09.087
Tell me, how's it going?

02:09.170 --> 02:10.421
Master.

02:10.505 --> 02:14.843
What the heck are you doing?

02:14.926 --> 02:16.886
- They're here?
- I'll get the door!

02:16.970 --> 02:18.721
Right, right. Get the door!

02:18.805 --> 02:20.682
- It was peaches!
- Peaches, huh?

02:21.391 --> 02:23.518
When our guests arrive,
prepare a plate for them.

02:23.601 --> 02:24.435
Right!

02:24.519 --> 02:27.522
Master, you sure are keyed up!

02:30.775 --> 02:32.318
I see.

02:32.402 --> 02:36.781
So you're telling me your desire
to train under me is even stronger now?

02:36.865 --> 02:39.200
Yes. It hit me hard that
at my skill level now,

02:39.284 --> 02:42.245
I'll never reach the rank of Shin'uchi.

02:42.328 --> 02:44.038
I want to hone my skills more.

02:44.122 --> 02:46.291
I don't want to waste
even a second or a minute.

02:46.374 --> 02:47.750
So please...

02:47.834 --> 02:49.502
Allow me to become your apprentice!

02:50.670 --> 02:53.464
Fine. I'll accept you as my apprentice.

02:53.548 --> 02:54.716
Yeah!

02:56.509 --> 02:58.845
No, I can't let myself be satisfied
with this.

02:58.928 --> 03:00.054
This is just the start line!

03:00.138 --> 03:03.433
That said, your official apprenticeship
will start next spring,

03:03.516 --> 03:05.393
after you've graduated high school.

03:05.476 --> 03:08.646
Until then, you'll be coming here
as a trainee.

03:08.730 --> 03:10.106
- Understood?
- Yes!

03:10.189 --> 03:14.193
Also, you're to come here
on an official visit with your parents.

03:14.277 --> 03:15.278
My parents?

03:15.361 --> 03:18.156
As a profession, Rakugo is unstable.

03:18.239 --> 03:21.492
And your family has been through a lot.

03:21.576 --> 03:24.913
Um, Dad's in Tokyo for work,
so he's not here.

03:24.996 --> 03:26.748
Can I come with just my mom?

03:26.831 --> 03:29.334
Yes, I know. That's fine.

03:29.417 --> 03:31.878
Understood! See you tomorrow, then!

03:31.961 --> 03:33.254
Tomorrow?

03:33.338 --> 03:36.090
U-Uh, right. Great!

03:38.009 --> 03:41.554
Look at me sweating bullets
when I'm the one who summoned them.

03:41.638 --> 03:42.722
How pathetic.

03:44.599 --> 03:48.061
I haven't seen Masaki since that day, huh?

03:48.561 --> 03:51.940
I never even told her that
I was teaching Akane Rakugo.

03:52.023 --> 03:54.859
How am I supposed to act when I see her?

03:55.485 --> 03:58.196
That kid's father
was the master's top apprentice,

03:58.279 --> 04:01.449
Shinta Ani-san,
who got expelled six years ago.

04:01.532 --> 04:03.159
Of course it's gonna be awkward.

04:05.411 --> 04:06.621
Pardon us!

04:06.704 --> 04:09.207
Hold on, should we
be barging in like this?

04:09.290 --> 04:11.167
Why not? It was open, anyway.

04:12.543 --> 04:15.088
Oh, Master, I brought Mom with me.

04:15.171 --> 04:18.633
Dummy! You should call me "Mother"
at times like these.

04:21.552 --> 04:24.639
Master Shiguma,
I haven't seen you since that day.

04:24.722 --> 04:25.640
It's been a long time.

04:26.224 --> 04:28.768
R-Right, Masa-chan.

04:28.851 --> 04:30.603
Long time... no see.

04:35.441 --> 04:37.360
Thank you for your hospitality.

04:37.443 --> 04:39.570
No, no. It's nothing.

04:39.654 --> 04:42.740
There's an unpleasant
grownup vibe washing over us.

04:42.824 --> 04:43.866
Awkward!

04:43.950 --> 04:46.911
Hey. These peaches are misshapen, huh?

04:46.995 --> 04:48.663
Damn, can't you read the room?

04:55.545 --> 04:58.381
I need to apologize to you
for something, Masaki.

04:59.632 --> 05:03.886
I've been training Akane in Rakugo
for the last six years.

05:04.470 --> 05:06.723
Part of it was because
her passion overwhelmed me.

05:06.806 --> 05:09.100
But it was mainly to atone
for what happened to Shinta,

05:09.183 --> 05:11.602
and to make this kid give up on her dream.

05:11.686 --> 05:15.648
Even so, I should've spoken to you
before we got to this point.

05:15.732 --> 05:17.317
I'm so sorry for not telling you.

05:17.400 --> 05:19.027
Excuse me, I knew.

05:19.110 --> 05:19.944
What?

05:20.028 --> 05:22.739
That you'd taken Akane under your wing.

05:22.822 --> 05:24.073
You knew about it?

05:24.157 --> 05:26.367
Yes. Because this girl
blabs about everything.

05:26.451 --> 05:28.453
Well, it's not something
I needed to hide, right?

05:28.536 --> 05:31.581
Then you're fine
with her performing Rakugo?

05:31.664 --> 05:34.000
Oh, I'm totally against it!

05:34.083 --> 05:35.710
Since that incident happened.

05:35.793 --> 05:37.295
Then, why?

05:37.378 --> 05:40.256
It's no use trying to stop her.
Not this girl.

05:40.840 --> 05:44.052
I also went against my own
parents' wishes to become a hairdresser.

05:44.135 --> 05:47.180
She takes after me,
so there's nothing I can do.

05:47.263 --> 05:51.225
And I knew that
you were taking good care of her.

05:53.519 --> 05:55.480
Most of all, my husband told me,

05:55.563 --> 05:58.733
"If it's Master Shiguma,
there's nothing to worry about."

06:02.528 --> 06:05.948
Masaki. I couldn't protect
my own apprentice.

06:06.032 --> 06:08.659
So I'm not fit to take on another.

06:08.743 --> 06:13.915
But as I continued to watch
this kid's Rakugo, I started to dream.

06:13.998 --> 06:17.460
I wondered what kind of Rakugoka
Akane would become.

06:18.086 --> 06:20.546
You may be thinking,
"Isn't it too late for this?"

06:20.630 --> 06:24.383
But if you would allow me to take her on...

06:25.176 --> 06:29.180
Incompetent as I am, I, Shiguma Arakawa
will pour all my heart and soul

06:29.263 --> 06:32.558
into training this child
to become a fine Rakugoka. I swear it!

06:32.642 --> 06:35.144
Master! Same here!

06:35.812 --> 06:38.773
I will become a Rakugoka
worthy of your name, Master.

06:38.856 --> 06:40.441
Please look after me!

06:41.567 --> 06:42.944
All right, me too.

06:44.028 --> 06:46.864
Please look after my daughter.

06:48.324 --> 06:50.952
You've received your family's approval.

06:52.537 --> 06:55.540
Once you've graduated high school,
you'll be my apprentice.

06:56.374 --> 06:59.961
I'm sure you already know this,
but Rakugoka are assigned ranks,

07:00.044 --> 07:03.047
and they rise through the hierarchy
according to their experience and skills.

07:03.756 --> 07:04.882
Zenza.

07:04.966 --> 07:07.385
The training period when becoming
a Rakugoka.

07:07.468 --> 07:09.428
While being consumed
by daily chores and training,

07:09.512 --> 07:12.056
you build up your foundation
as a Rakugoka.

07:12.640 --> 07:14.058
Futatsume.

07:14.142 --> 07:17.562
Those who've been recognized as Rakugoka
use this period to hone their craft.

07:18.146 --> 07:22.024
You're also allowed to wear haori and
hakama from the Futatsume tier.

07:22.859 --> 07:24.235
Shin'uchi.

07:24.318 --> 07:26.446
The pinnacle of the Rakugo world.

07:26.529 --> 07:28.281
At the Arakawa School,

07:28.364 --> 07:30.783
the Shin'uchi rank is conferred to those
who've become masters of their craft.

07:31.993 --> 07:34.412
While striving to elevate
their personal art form,

07:34.495 --> 07:37.248
they're also permitted to take on
apprentices and train the next generation.

07:37.874 --> 07:39.959
Your official apprenticeship
starts next spring.

07:40.042 --> 07:42.462
That said,
there's no time to waste idling about!

07:42.545 --> 07:44.088
Let me introduce you.

07:44.922 --> 07:47.049
These four are my students.

07:48.009 --> 07:50.678
They're all Futatsume,
and every one of them is a piece of work.

07:51.262 --> 07:54.807
Starting now, these four will drive
the basics of Rakugo into your head.

07:54.891 --> 07:57.351
The training will be tough,
but you can handle it, right?

07:57.435 --> 07:58.269
Of course I can!

07:58.352 --> 08:00.980
Uh, Master. About that...

08:01.063 --> 08:02.773
We respectfully decline.

08:06.235 --> 08:08.738
Huh? You didn't tell them?

08:08.821 --> 08:10.406
Listen, you rogues!

08:11.115 --> 08:15.119
It's your job as elder fellow apprentices
to look after the newly accepted students!

08:15.203 --> 08:19.332
That's true, but it's been six years?
Seven, since Guriko?

08:19.415 --> 08:22.335
If our first new student in years
quits because of me...

08:22.418 --> 08:24.086
Nope nope nope nope nope nope!

08:24.170 --> 08:27.131
Master, come on, it's me!

08:27.215 --> 08:29.967
That kid will fall head over heels
in love with me for sure!

08:30.051 --> 08:31.969
A romance that would be against the rules!

08:32.053 --> 08:33.429
Don't you agree, Guririn?

08:33.513 --> 08:36.390
Huh? Well, um...

08:36.474 --> 08:39.477
- Th-Then I'll do--
- Let me look after her, for starters.

08:39.560 --> 08:40.394
KYOJI ARAKAWA

08:40.478 --> 08:42.063
Master, is that all right with you?

08:42.146 --> 08:43.481
- Fine by me.
- Grin!

08:43.564 --> 08:45.816
Kyoji, I'm leaving her in your hands.

08:45.900 --> 08:46.901
As you wish.

08:46.984 --> 08:50.112
Guriko. Your concern for your
younger apprentice is commendable.

08:50.696 --> 08:53.407
But you've only just become a Futatsume.

08:53.491 --> 08:56.035
Right now, you need to focus
on honing your own craft.

08:56.118 --> 08:56.953
Right.

08:57.620 --> 08:59.413
You, there. Come over here.

09:01.791 --> 09:04.001
The younger Rakugoka
always greet the others first.

09:04.085 --> 09:05.044
Uh, right.

09:06.546 --> 09:08.005
My name is Akane Osaki.

09:08.089 --> 09:09.924
Pleased to meet you.

09:10.007 --> 09:13.386
- Yeah. That's a polite, good bow.
- What?

09:13.469 --> 09:16.764
Every performance starts
and ends with a bow.

09:16.847 --> 09:19.350
The sight of a polite bow
is also pleasing to the audience.

09:19.433 --> 09:21.978
Wow, he's really pouring it on
with the compliments!

09:22.061 --> 09:23.646
He might be a nice guy.

09:23.729 --> 09:25.690
I'm Kyoji Arakawa.

09:25.773 --> 09:28.150
You'll be accompanying me
for the time being.

09:28.234 --> 09:29.235
What's your school schedule?

09:29.318 --> 09:31.237
Oh, you don't have to worry about that.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.239
It'll be totally fine if I ditch class.

09:33.322 --> 09:34.532
Idiot!

09:34.615 --> 09:38.244
The high school that your parents put
you in, with your best interests at heart.

09:38.327 --> 09:39.870
You're saying you want to ditch it?

09:39.954 --> 09:41.914
Outrageous!

09:41.998 --> 09:44.750
As a student, your duty is to study!

09:44.834 --> 09:47.587
Don't get your priorities wrong!

09:47.670 --> 09:48.504
R-Right.

09:48.588 --> 09:50.673
As long as we're clear, it's fine.

09:50.756 --> 09:52.758
That was one quick baptism by fire.

09:53.342 --> 09:55.386
Ever since Shinta Ani-san was expelled,

09:55.469 --> 09:59.599
Kyoji Ani-san has taken charge
of the Shiguma School apprentices.

09:59.682 --> 10:00.641
He's also known as...

10:01.434 --> 10:04.103
the Magistrate of the Shiguma School!

10:04.770 --> 10:06.939
All right, I'm texting you
the address of tomorrow's venue.

10:07.023 --> 10:08.691
Oh, crap. This guy...

10:09.275 --> 10:11.777
I think he's the type
that I totally can't deal with!

10:11.861 --> 10:15.239
STUDIO THREE

10:16.782 --> 10:19.452
All right, though you're still a novice...

10:19.535 --> 10:22.246
I will now teach you what you need
to learn for your Zenza training!

10:22.830 --> 10:24.707
- Soak in all you can!
- Thanks!

10:24.790 --> 10:27.460
It's finally starting today.

10:27.543 --> 10:30.671
My road to becoming a Shin'uchi,
and catching up to that guy.

10:30.755 --> 10:32.256
I'll master it all right away!

10:32.340 --> 10:33.424
All right, let's begin!

10:33.507 --> 10:36.010
- Start by straightening everyone's shoes!
- Right!

10:36.093 --> 10:39.180
Greet others properly!
They're the proprietors of this venue.

10:39.263 --> 10:40.097
Right!

10:40.181 --> 10:42.183
When you get to the dressing room,
serve tea!

10:42.266 --> 10:44.060
- Make it hot and strong.
- Right!

10:44.143 --> 10:46.354
- Help me get dressed!
- Right!

10:47.688 --> 10:49.774
Fold my discarded clothes neatly!

10:49.857 --> 10:50.691
And also...

10:51.275 --> 10:53.361
It's all menial chores!

10:53.444 --> 10:54.403
What did you expect?

10:54.987 --> 10:56.530
When you've just started training,

10:56.614 --> 10:59.617
your job is all those chores
that you just did.

11:00.368 --> 11:02.495
I bet you're thinking,
"That has nothing to do with Rakugo."

11:02.578 --> 11:06.457
But Rakugo is all about making the people
in front of you happy.

11:06.540 --> 11:09.835
You can't handle this job if you can't
make one person around you happy.

11:09.919 --> 11:12.129
You have to think about what would make

11:12.213 --> 11:14.757
that person happy,
and constantly anticipate their needs.

11:14.840 --> 11:17.385
Rakugoka call this "attentiveness."

11:17.885 --> 11:20.846
If you can't even do that,
you'll never become a Zenza.

11:20.930 --> 11:21.764
Right.

11:21.847 --> 11:24.141
Attentiveness, huh?

11:24.225 --> 11:27.686
But at the end of the day, it's the Rakugo
that makes the audience happy!

11:27.770 --> 11:28.854
That guy even said so.

11:28.938 --> 11:30.731
In Rakugo, artistic skill counts the most!

11:31.315 --> 11:34.318
It's art! In the end,
Rakugo is all about art!

11:34.402 --> 11:36.320
Good morning!

11:36.404 --> 11:39.448
Mr. Hakushu Kashiwaya just arrived.
Greet him!

11:39.532 --> 11:40.449
Yo.

11:40.533 --> 11:42.576
So you're Akane, huh?

11:42.660 --> 11:45.871
I heard about you,
but you really are young!

11:45.955 --> 11:48.249
Listen, can you take the stage today?

11:48.332 --> 11:49.625
- What?
- Hakushu!

11:49.708 --> 11:51.544
She's going to be apprenticed, right?

11:51.627 --> 11:53.337
It's just you and me performing, anyway.

11:53.421 --> 11:55.047
I can do it! I have my kimono, too!

11:55.673 --> 11:57.716
Please allow me to take the stage!

12:12.440 --> 12:18.571
FUTATSUME PERFORMANCE

12:19.155 --> 12:22.533
I don't agree with putting someone on
stage before they've been apprenticed.

12:22.616 --> 12:24.952
I've at least
drilled the stories into her.

12:25.035 --> 12:27.872
She's not an official apprentice,
but you can put her on stage.

12:27.955 --> 12:30.207
Guess we'll see what she's got.

12:30.291 --> 12:32.626
I'm not as nervous as I was before.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.295
I can see my surroundings, too.

12:34.378 --> 12:35.880
All right. Here goes!

12:35.963 --> 12:40.843
I'm going to make him realize that
in Rakugo, it's art that's crucial!

12:40.926 --> 12:44.889
Well, you know how they say that
borrowed plumes will soon come off.

12:44.972 --> 12:48.184
Apparently, mimicking others
doesn't ever go well.

12:48.267 --> 12:49.643
This Makura...

12:49.727 --> 12:51.020
Is she going to perform
"Praising Children"?

12:51.103 --> 12:52.438
Hattsan? What are you doing here?

12:52.521 --> 12:55.357
Well, I just heard from someone nearby...

12:55.441 --> 12:57.818
I see. She's good, all right.

12:57.902 --> 13:00.696
Not just her performance
and how expressive she is,

13:00.779 --> 13:03.532
but more than anything,
her sitting posture is lovely.

13:03.616 --> 13:05.868
Oh, looks like you heard it wrong.

13:05.951 --> 13:07.286
Some relatives send me sake...

13:07.369 --> 13:10.080
Her core is stable,
as if she's rooted to the stage.

13:10.164 --> 13:12.583
That's not something
you acquire overnight.

13:12.666 --> 13:14.627
She must've put in tireless work
to hone that skill.

13:15.419 --> 13:16.420
But...

13:16.504 --> 13:18.589
Free, three, who cares which one?

13:18.672 --> 13:20.799
Just give me a drink, you cheapskate!

13:24.345 --> 13:25.304
Huh?

13:25.387 --> 13:27.306
How can you call me a cheapskate?

13:27.389 --> 13:30.476
It's not like I'm a total bust,
but I don't know.

13:30.559 --> 13:32.019
It's not like the response I got before.

13:34.021 --> 13:35.147
No, it's fine!

13:35.231 --> 13:37.775
If I let out everything I've learned,
then they'll laugh!

13:37.858 --> 13:39.109
That's how it works, see?

13:39.777 --> 13:41.612
Oh, so there are ways to get it done, huh?

13:42.196 --> 13:45.032
But why? I think I'm doing okay.

13:45.115 --> 13:48.035
"I've at least drilled the stories
into her," huh?

13:48.619 --> 13:51.872
Master, now I really understand
what you meant.

13:54.583 --> 13:55.960
You look depressed.

13:57.086 --> 13:59.255
You weren't happy
with your performance today?

14:01.006 --> 14:02.675
Talk about insolent.

14:02.758 --> 14:05.052
Hakushu's kindness
is what allowed you to take the stage.

14:05.135 --> 14:06.387
It's not that I'm unhappy. Not at all!

14:07.096 --> 14:09.348
I couldn't be more grateful.

14:09.431 --> 14:14.019
Hearing Mr. Hakushu and the audience
praise me made me so happy.

14:14.603 --> 14:19.859
But more than that, not getting
huge waves of laughter really stung.

14:19.942 --> 14:22.945
That never
would've happened to him, I bet.

14:23.028 --> 14:25.739
I found out how lame I am.

14:25.823 --> 14:28.534
I have to train harder,
and polish my Rakugo more.

14:28.617 --> 14:32.496
So if you can just polish your craft,
you can satisfy the audience?

14:32.580 --> 14:34.748
Uh, well, isn't that what it's about?

14:34.832 --> 14:36.208
You sure are arrogant.

14:37.334 --> 14:40.129
Your Rakugo couldn't be more selfish.

14:40.212 --> 14:41.380
Self...

14:41.463 --> 14:42.923
Huh? What do you mean?

14:43.007 --> 14:44.174
Let me ask you, then.

14:44.258 --> 14:46.635
There were a lot of
older audience members today.

14:46.719 --> 14:50.222
How did you tailor your act
to get laughs out of them?

14:50.306 --> 14:51.348
Well, that's...

14:51.432 --> 14:54.810
If I let out everything I've learned,
then they'll laugh!

14:56.312 --> 14:58.522
About today's performance,
to me it seemed like...

15:00.274 --> 15:04.111
you were throwing 93 mph balls
over and over.

15:04.194 --> 15:05.988
The pitches seem incredible
because they're fast,

15:06.572 --> 15:09.867
but since they don't land in the strike
zone, your performance isn't funny.

15:09.950 --> 15:11.160
I acknowledge your talent.

15:11.243 --> 15:15.039
But Rakugo is all about how much
you can make the audience laugh.

15:15.122 --> 15:17.833
It's not inward that
you need to gaze into right now.

15:17.917 --> 15:19.043
It's outward.

15:22.254 --> 15:23.714
I've given them a heads-up.

15:23.797 --> 15:25.007
Starting tomorrow, you'll be going there.

15:25.841 --> 15:29.261
How can you perform Rakugo
in a way that makes others happy?

15:29.345 --> 15:31.221
Find the answer to the question yourself.

15:32.264 --> 15:34.975
Understood! I'll get it done!

15:37.645 --> 15:38.938
UMI

15:39.021 --> 15:42.483
Wait, the place where
I'm supposed to learn is an izakaya?

15:43.108 --> 15:45.736
Huh? Wait, did he just want
to get rid of me?

15:45.819 --> 15:48.864
Like he's saying, "You're in the way,
so buzz off!" So deflating.

15:48.948 --> 15:50.699
Hey, Newbie! Get to work!

15:51.283 --> 15:54.954
Still, even though I've only known him
for a couple of days, I really get him.

15:55.037 --> 15:57.790
I know that he's going to teach me
all kinds of stuff.

15:58.374 --> 16:01.043
My experience here
has a purpose, for sure!

16:02.461 --> 16:04.672
Welcome! Do you have a reservation?

16:04.755 --> 16:06.256
Huh? No, I don't...

16:06.340 --> 16:08.676
A newcomer! Please, have a seat over here!

16:08.759 --> 16:12.179
An izakaya, customer service,
and attentiveness...

16:12.262 --> 16:13.472
There's only one answer.

16:13.555 --> 16:16.767
He wants me to learn attentiveness here,
and use it in my Rakugo!

16:16.850 --> 16:19.061
I'm going to apply myself,
and learn it right away!

16:19.645 --> 16:20.854
Welcome!

16:23.107 --> 16:25.234
You sent Akane to Izakaya Umi, the bar?

16:25.317 --> 16:29.196
Yes. I have a lot of regional work
this week, so I can't accompany her.

16:29.279 --> 16:30.197
I thought it would be a good opportunity.

16:30.280 --> 16:33.492
I see. She's at Miku-chan's place, huh?

16:33.993 --> 16:35.953
Things are getting interesting, eh?

16:36.954 --> 16:38.038
Welcome!

16:38.122 --> 16:40.416
Would you like something
from our Specials menu?

16:40.499 --> 16:42.835
We make this dish with Spanish mackerel!

16:42.918 --> 16:43.877
We're not ready.

16:43.961 --> 16:47.631
- And here we have our pride and joy...
- Akane!

16:53.595 --> 16:56.932
I hate to tell you this,
but you're trying a little too hard, okay?

16:57.850 --> 17:00.936
You might want to dial down
the volume of your voice, too.

17:01.020 --> 17:03.897
But aren't you supposed to be cheerful
and energetic towards customers at a bar?

17:03.981 --> 17:05.357
I just looked it up online!

17:05.441 --> 17:08.193
Oh, sure, of course,
that's also really important.

17:08.277 --> 17:12.740
But listen, before you try so hard,
you have to look at people first.

17:15.868 --> 17:18.037
That's what the manager told me.

17:18.120 --> 17:21.498
What do you think that means?
That trying hard isn't good, maybe?

17:21.582 --> 17:23.417
Who knows, really?

17:23.500 --> 17:26.545
Hiiragi-san,
I'm really struggling with this!

17:26.628 --> 17:29.381
Well, I don't think it's a bad thing.

17:29.465 --> 17:31.842
But I think the important thing
isn't just to try hard,

17:31.925 --> 17:34.511
and instead, we want people
to come here again?

17:34.595 --> 17:36.263
After all, this isn't a sport.

17:36.346 --> 17:39.224
Why don't you try it the way
he told you for now?

17:40.976 --> 17:43.020
Thanks for waiting!

17:45.064 --> 17:46.940
Right. Got it.

17:49.318 --> 17:50.778
No, I'm telling you...

17:50.861 --> 17:52.905
I'm not complaining, okay?

17:54.740 --> 17:56.075
I'm so wiped!

17:56.158 --> 17:59.620
I tried all the things I looked up,
but none of it is working.

17:59.703 --> 18:02.289
And I'm just causing Hiiragi-san trouble.

18:03.332 --> 18:06.085
Wait, am I doing the same thing again?

18:06.877 --> 18:09.463
Taking what I've learned,
and just throwing it out there.

18:09.546 --> 18:11.507
I'm not thinking about the people
in front of me.

18:11.590 --> 18:13.717
You couldn't be more selfish.

18:13.801 --> 18:16.929
What a moron I am! I haven't...

18:17.012 --> 18:18.555
Oh, are you on a break?

18:18.639 --> 18:20.474
So? Are you used to the job now?

18:20.557 --> 18:22.559
Well, of course
you wouldn't be on day one.

18:22.643 --> 18:25.771
- He can be so reckless, that Kyo-chan!
- Kyo-chan?

18:25.854 --> 18:28.440
I mean Kyoji. He's a regular here.

18:28.524 --> 18:29.399
Oh?

18:29.483 --> 18:32.694
But he can't hold his liquor,
so he always drinks orange juice.

18:32.778 --> 18:35.197
How adorable is that?

18:35.280 --> 18:36.115
Boss.

18:36.865 --> 18:38.575
Attentive, thoughtful.

18:38.659 --> 18:41.411
How can I learn to be that way?

18:41.495 --> 18:44.164
I was told that if I couldn't,
I can never even become a Zenza.

18:44.248 --> 18:45.749
So I can't afford to mess up.

18:46.583 --> 18:47.960
Thoughtful, huh?

18:48.043 --> 18:51.797
That's actually something that
I learned from a Rakugoka.

18:51.880 --> 18:52.923
From a Rakugoka?

18:53.006 --> 18:57.427
I've always loved Rakugo,
and I went to see performances a lot.

18:57.511 --> 19:00.722
That's when I happened to see
Master Shiguma.

19:00.806 --> 19:03.475
I'm sure he can read people's minds!

19:03.559 --> 19:05.561
Whenever I wanted to laugh or cry,
he'd hit me

19:05.644 --> 19:07.271
with precision and perfect timing!

19:07.354 --> 19:09.940
You don't know how good that made me feel.

19:10.524 --> 19:13.902
I wondered if I could do that myself,
and I tried all kinds of things.

19:13.986 --> 19:15.112
Oh?

19:15.195 --> 19:19.116
Well, hey, who doesn't feel joy
when they're being cared for so well?

19:19.199 --> 19:22.953
If you want people to like you,
then first you need to accept them.

19:23.036 --> 19:26.331
You're young, so don't overthink it,
and try some things out.

19:26.415 --> 19:29.168
Even if you fail, no worries.

19:29.251 --> 19:31.587
Turning failure into a funny story.

19:31.670 --> 19:33.547
Isn't that what makes Rakugo so great?

19:34.381 --> 19:37.843
Dear me! I just lectured
a Rakugoka about Rakugo!

19:37.926 --> 19:40.012
Please forgive me for my arrogance!

19:40.095 --> 19:41.305
No, not at all!

19:41.388 --> 19:42.431
That was really moving!

19:42.514 --> 19:44.892
Boss, do you have a second?

19:49.771 --> 19:53.859
Um, are you... Your order? No, wait, um...

19:54.610 --> 19:56.612
I don't think he's speaking English.

19:56.695 --> 19:58.155
What should we do?

19:58.655 --> 20:02.034
Hey, I know! There's an app for that!
Um, sorry!

20:02.117 --> 20:03.619
Uh, hello!

20:05.495 --> 20:07.706
Think about the person before you.

20:07.789 --> 20:09.708
What's on this person's mind?

20:09.791 --> 20:11.501
What does he want to tell us?

20:11.585 --> 20:12.461
The menu...

20:13.462 --> 20:15.505
Maybe he doesn't understand Japanese.

20:15.589 --> 20:16.840
I mean, there are no photos.

20:16.924 --> 20:19.676
But I have no idea
how I can explain it to him.

20:19.760 --> 20:20.886
In that case...

20:21.470 --> 20:22.846
This. Watch me.

20:35.025 --> 20:36.276
Beer?

20:36.360 --> 20:38.737
Right! Yes, yes! Probably yes!

20:38.820 --> 20:41.281
Um, next up...

20:42.157 --> 20:44.034
Here, take my phone...

20:44.117 --> 20:45.285
It's all good now.

20:46.703 --> 20:49.039
Gotta hand it to those Rakugoka, huh?

20:49.122 --> 20:49.998
Yakitori!

20:50.832 --> 20:52.125
Here you go!

20:53.669 --> 20:55.254
Now sit back and enjoy!

20:55.837 --> 20:56.880
Arigato!

20:59.383 --> 21:00.425
Oh, thanks.

21:01.134 --> 21:04.429
Wow, this is intense! I'm so thrilled!

21:04.513 --> 21:06.223
Akane, nice going!

21:06.306 --> 21:07.808
Loved the way you chugged it!

21:07.891 --> 21:09.268
Was that a Rakugo skill?

21:09.351 --> 21:10.352
You crushed it!

21:10.435 --> 21:12.396
Keep that up, okay?

21:13.188 --> 21:14.439
Right!

21:15.524 --> 21:18.402
AKANE RUNA HIIRAGI SATORU SHOUMA
KAZU AKI YUUTO NOE MICHIRU

21:18.485 --> 21:19.653
Good evening!

21:19.736 --> 21:21.280
Hey, Kyo-chan!

21:21.363 --> 21:23.365
- I just got back now.
- Welcome back!

21:23.448 --> 21:26.952
Thank you for looking after
my junior apprentice for a whole week.

21:27.035 --> 21:28.370
Here's something for you.

21:28.453 --> 21:30.539
Oh, my, thanks so much!

21:30.622 --> 21:32.416
My pleasure!
She was a huge help, actually!

21:32.499 --> 21:34.584
All right, then, I'll have my usual.

21:37.004 --> 21:39.006
Here you go. Orange juice.

21:39.715 --> 21:40.757
That's thoughtful of you.

21:40.841 --> 21:44.219
Well, sure.
Miku-chan trained me well, after all!

21:44.303 --> 21:45.345
Have you found your answer?

21:46.013 --> 21:49.099
Maybe you should be
the judge of that yourself?

21:50.976 --> 21:51.810
Fine.

21:51.893 --> 21:54.479
I have some business
in the city next weekend.

21:54.563 --> 21:55.856
You should come along.

21:57.024 --> 21:59.943
Let me see, in detail,
what you've learned.

22:00.652 --> 22:01.737
Right!

23:36.123 --> 23:37.874
NEXT EPISODE
BEYOND JOY

23:38.750 --> 23:40.544
Akane Small Talk!

23:44.214 --> 23:45.340
Now that you've accepted me

23:45.423 --> 23:47.300
as your apprentice,
I can't hold back my excitement!

23:47.384 --> 23:48.760
Right?

23:48.844 --> 23:51.721
There are no schools or
training institutes for Rakugoka.

23:51.805 --> 23:52.722
If you want to become one,

23:52.806 --> 23:56.977
the only way is to get apprenticed
to a Shin'uchi, and train.

23:57.060 --> 23:59.980
That's the first step
everyone has to take.

24:00.063 --> 24:02.899
Well, whether or not you have
no problems getting accepted

24:02.983 --> 24:04.860
depends on who your master is.

24:04.943 --> 24:06.736
Oh, really? Is that right?

24:06.820 --> 24:09.990
Yes. While some may get a quick, "Yes,"

24:10.073 --> 24:11.908
it's not uncommon to hear about people

24:11.992 --> 24:14.995
who finally got accepted
after months of pleading.

24:15.078 --> 24:17.539
It took me six years! Six years!

24:17.622 --> 24:21.793
In your case, you'd been watching training
sessions since before you were taken on,

24:21.877 --> 24:23.670
so I'd say it was a special case.

24:23.753 --> 24:25.255
Special, huh?

24:25.338 --> 24:29.885
Some start by waiting by the dressing room
door at yose theaters to greet them,

24:29.968 --> 24:33.054
and others visit
the master's house, unannounced.

24:33.138 --> 24:35.265
Everyone struggles
when trying to get apprenticed.

24:35.348 --> 24:37.726
Did you struggle, too, to get accepted?

24:37.809 --> 24:40.645
Well, of course!
I prostrated myself on the street.

24:40.729 --> 24:42.898
- What?
- Oh! Well, you know...

24:42.981 --> 24:45.650
Someday if it comes up,
I'll tell you about that.

24:45.734 --> 24:46.568
Oh, right!

24:46.651 --> 24:48.111
- Um, I've got to practice "Shinigami."
- Hey, I have to know!

24:48.195 --> 24:50.280
Please tell me, Master!

24:50.363 --> 24:52.449
Master!
